Models the issue's build-state-reuse contract: product tasks that share
build state are connected to a single executor/workspace via typed edges,
and an auditor walker traverses the typed task graph, reusing workspace
state instead of rebuilding, and detecting cycles explicitly (jac walkers
do not dedupe visits on their own).
