"""Kanban durable plumbing demo: idempotent task creation, system-only block kinds, and a ledger-clearing audit walk.

Tasks own goals via typed GoalFor edges; blocked-by relations use BlockedBy
edges carrying the block kind. The Auditor walker replays lineage over typed
edges with an explicit visited-set cycle policy (no built-in dedupe), and an
