"""Requirement include resolution with alias-safe cycle detection.

Each ReqFile node stores its canonical path; Includes edges carry the raw
(in possibly aliased) target path. The resolver keeps the active include
chain apart from the set of already processed files: a diamond is
processed once, a cycle (parent alias or symlink) is reported with the chain.
"""

node ReqFile {
    has path: str = "";       # canonical path of this file
    has content: str = "";    # demo payload
