A ``Surveyor`` walker counts each app's dependency load in a single O(N+E)
pass over the edges. The ``Resolver`` runs Kahn's algorithm natively: each
resolved app walks its reverse edges (``NeededBy``, precomputed instead of
nested scans, exactly the O(N+E) fix proposed in issue #803) to find
dependents whose in-degree drops to zero.
