The issue complains about hand-rolled roadmap machinery (id-keyed maps and
manual recursion over dependencies). Here each checklist item is a node,
dependencies are typed edges, and a ReleaseAuditor walker traverses the
dependency graph with an explicit visited-guard cycle policy (jac walkers
do not dedupe visits on cyclic graphs), reporting items in a safe order.
