"""Corrections: preserve original answer, link replacement, run impact analysis.

Confirmed errors append a Correction (no UPDATE/DELETE — invariant 5), link the
replacement Answer Snapshot with a typed edge, and a walker walks the affected
record graph marking materially impacted records REVIEW_REQUIRED (impact analysis).
